WEBVTT

00:09:29.279 --> 00:09:31.079
in constitutions worldwide.

00:09:31.422 --> 00:09:35.176
In the Charter of Fundamental Rights
of the European Union,

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.554
this right expressly applies
to mental integrity.

00:09:39.347 --> 00:09:42.005
But even if the potentially
traumatic effect

00:09:42.029 --> 00:09:44.855
of images and videos is hard to predict,

00:09:44.879 --> 00:09:46.836
do we want to become so cautious

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:50.587
that we risk losing
social awareness of injustice?

00:09:51.203 --> 00:09:52.353
So what to do?

00:09:52.942 --> 00:09:55.934
Mark Zuckerberg recently stated
that in the future,

00:09:55.958 --> 00:09:59.760
the users, we, or almost everybody,

00:09:59.784 --> 00:10:02.045
will decide individually